      "description": "Name Sliver: every creature that is not a Sliver is destroyed. All 38 creatures in the 99 survive, Morophon included (changeling counts as every creature type). Seven mana at sorcery speed, and cascade never reveals it (mana value 7), so it is a hard-cast reset. It is the deck's only true board wipe beside Cyclonic Rift, and the only one that leaves our board untouched.",
